            "review_title": "Review at HoaVien",
            "review_text": "Dave6247\nSydney, Australia33 contributions\n0\nGood beer!\nMay 2019 • Business\nWe had a booking with a group of 12 locals and dined in one of the upstairs party rooms. They have two signature style beers, one a larger and one darker style. The beer was great, tasted freshly brewed and was cold on a hot day. We shared a number of dishes, most were local Vietnamese-style food, but we really enjoyed the fried potato triangles. The service was great, regularly bringing out more food and topping up the drinks. Definitely recommend the place for locals, tourists will enjoy the beer but may find a better meal somewhere else.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 25, 2019",
